Well, what happens when you replace this computation with the quantum version of this computation?

30
00:02:58,240 --> 00:03:02,660
假设这是我那神奇的量子计算机。
So let's say this is my amazing quantum computer.

31
00:03:03,214 --> 00:03:08,320
它的运作方式非常相似，如果你输入这个比特串，你会得到另一个比特串。
It acts in a very similar way, where if you put in this bit string, you'll get out another bit string.

32
00:03:08,718 --> 00:03:15,908
但量子计算机能做而经典计算机做不到的事情是，你可以同时输入多个输入。
But the thing that you can do with quantum computers that you can't with
a classical computer is you can put in more than one input at a time.

33
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:27,940
事实上，你可以输入每一个可能的比特串，而输出不再是单个数字，
而是所有输入对应的输出结果的组合。
In fact, you can put in every possible bit string, and the output, instead of being a single number,
will be a combination of all of the outputs for every single one of the inputs.

