00:06:47,566 --> 00:06:54,244
就像，没错，你可以通过检查每一个因子来完成，但这会花上非常长的时间。
Like, yes, you can do it by sort of just checking every single factor, but that will take you ages and ages.

67
00:06:54,478 --> 00:07:02,372
但在1999年，Peter Shor展示了实际上你可以在量子计算机上相当快地解决这个问题。
But in 1999, Peter Shaw showed that actually you can solve this problem quite quickly on a quantum computer.

68
00:07:02,638 --> 00:07:11,780
该算法的第一步看起来像是把所有输入的巨大叠加态放入量子计算机中并计算输出。
The first step of that algorithm does look like putting in a huge superposition
of all the inputs into a quantum computer and calculating the output.

69
